WasmFS OPFS backend: blocked-time accounting. Each proxy() round trip to the OPFS worker is timed per op
kind (count, blocked nanoseconds, bytes, a latency histogram with a 2 ms edge at the WasmFS proxy heartbeat),
read from JS through wasmfs_opfs_stat(kind, field) / wasmfs_opfs_stat_shape(what) -- ikvmcraft exports both
(-Wl,--export-if-defined) and its harness prints them as OPFS_BLOCKED. This was applied to the frozen emsdk
on 2026-09-07 without a patch here; recorded 2026-10-15 so freeze-emsdk.sh reproduces it.

